OL,3,GNEWSAThe farmer who turned to singing
OL,4,Aafter bovine TB silenced his fields
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen bovine TB led to the loss of his
OL,7,Fentire herd, dairy farmer Mervyn Kelso
OL,8,Fstruggled with the sadness of the empty
OL,9,Ffields and the silence of the milking
OL,10,Fyard.
OL,12,FIt was a traumatic time for a man who
OL,13,Fhad farmed his whole life, and it was
OL,14,Fhard watching his neighbours tend to
OL,15,Ftheir cows.
OL,17,FHis sister suggested he should join the
OL,18,FFarmers' Choir and that turned out to
OL,19,Fbe a "great lifter".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
