OL,3,GNEWSAThe farmer who turned to singing
OL,4,Aafter bovine TB silenced his fields
OL,5,
OL,6,FFast forward four years, and Mervyn has
OL,7,Fsung for the King, met musical royalty
OL,8,Fand his choir is up for a national
OL,9,Faward.
